{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/","title":"질환·증상 확장 지도","language":"ko-KR","description":"새로 추가된 통증·호흡기·여성건강 증상을 변증·본초·방제·침구로 연결합니다.","text":"질환·증상 확장 지도\n근골격계\n목통증\n어깨통증\n무릎통증\n요통\n주요 연결:\n침·약침·전침·부항 → 어혈·풍한습 → 두충·우슬·독활기생탕\n두면·신경계\n두통\n어지럼\n주요 연결:\n풍·담·어혈·간양 → 합곡·태충·풍지·백회\n호흡기\n비염\n기침\n주요 연결:\n폐기허·풍한·담음 → 황기·반하·맥문동 → 소청룡탕·생맥산\n여성건강\n갱년기\n산후회복\n주요 연결:\n신음·신양·기혈 → 녹용·당귀·숙지황 → 귀비탕·십전대보탕·경옥고\n의미\n이 지도는 증상을 특정 처방 하나에 고정하지 않고 증상 → 변증 → 본초·방제 → 침구·치료법으로 확장해 탐색하도록 만든다.","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"근골격계","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"두면·신경계","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"호흡기","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"여성건강","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/#_5"},{"level":2,"title":"의미","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-expansion-map/#_6"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/cough/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/dizziness/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/headache/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/knee-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/low-back-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/menopause/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/neck-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/postpartum-recovery/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/rhinitis/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/shoulder-pain/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations."}
